From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Share original cue, delay and source selection steps
Upstream-base: c7b2e663f878d38dc429ab12ee7db451daf0c217

Typed native callers validate complete resource closure before invoking these
original algorithms. Inject RNG state explicitly; retain console delegation.

